### Test Ride Flow - REST Client File
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension or similar

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@clientToken = YOUR_CLIENT_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@driverToken = YOUR_DRIVER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Client: Create a new ride
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rides
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

{
  "pickupLat": 33.5138,
  "pickupLng": 36.2765,
  "pickupAddress": "Damascus, Syria",
  "dropoffLat": 33.5102,
  "dropoffLng": 36.2913,
  "dropoffAddress": "Umayyad Square, Damascus",
  "type": "STANDARD",
  "maxPassengers": 1
}

### 2. Client: Get my rides
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rides
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### 3. Driver: Get nearby rides
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rides/nearby?maxDistance=10&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

### 4. Driver: Accept a ride (replace :id with actual ride ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rides/1/accept
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

### 5. Client: Start negotiation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rides/1/negotiate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

{
  "amount": 6.0,
  "message": "السعر غالي شوي"
}

### 6. Driver: Counter offer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rides/1/negotiate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

{
  "amount": 7.0,
  "message": "أقل شي 7"
}

### 7. Client: Accept negotiation
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/rides/1/negotiate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

{
  "action": "accept"
}

### 8. Driver: Update status to DRIVER_ARRIVED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/rides/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

{
  "status": "DRIVER_ARRIVED"
}

### 9. Driver: Update status to IN_PROGRESS
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/rides/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### 10. Driver: Update status to COMPLETED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/rides/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### 11. Client: Cancel a ride
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rides/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

{
  "reason": "تغير الخطط"
}

### 12. Get ride details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rides/1
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### ============================================
### Authentication Endpoints
### ============================================

### Send OTP to client
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+963911111111"
}

### Verify OTP for client
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+963911111111",
  "code": "123456"
}

### Send OTP to driver
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+963922222222"
}

### Verify OTP for driver
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+963922222222",
  "code": "123456"
}

### ============================================
### Carpooling Test
### ============================================

### Create carpooling ride
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rides
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

{
  "pickupLat": 33.5138,
  "pickupLng": 36.2765,
  "pickupAddress": "Damascus, Syria",
  "dropoffLat": 33.5102,
  "dropoffLng": 36.2913,
  "dropoffAddress": "Umayyad Square, Damascus",
  "type": "CARPOOLING",
  "maxPassengers": 4
}
